{"id": "known:f30af2b0899ff9108e31d0034526000f", "url": "/archive/known/?id=f30af2b0899ff9108e31d0034526000f", "source": "known", "type": "photos", "title": "WordPress.com May Have Best Following Reader integration #IndieWeb", "summary": "I add the blogs I follow widget. I then search and find a blog to follow. I click follow. I then see it on my blog as a follow. I then see @pauljacobson's post in my reader. In reply to a Tweet by jgmac1106", "date": "2018-10-15", "published": "2018-10-15T20:09:49+00:00", "author": "Greg McVerry", "reply_to": null, "tags": [], "access": "PUBLIC", "publish_status": "published", "body_html": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/archive/known/media/d6e9f135344a77d96aeeed22d2a8548a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<p>I add the blogs I follow widget.</p>\r\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/archive/known/media/8cc9686ce340765108e6b14dbc68e6a8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<p>I then search and find a blog to follow. I click follow.</p>\r\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/archive/known/media/be5c2336db48cf8e99fee7d6aefef162.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<p>I then see it on my blog as a follow.</p>\r\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/archive/known/media/57466fb0c28e0f4788012f423b888d68.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<p>I then see @pauljacobson&#x27;s post in my reader.</p>\r\n<p>In reply to a Tweet by<a href=\"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1051900091857063937\" rel=\"noreferrer\">jgmac1106</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/known/media/cb94ac007ac5041bf7ea6f7deab6e64d.png\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2018-10-15 at 4.00.41 PM.png\"></figure>", "reply_urls": [], "original_url": "http://quickthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/view/f30af2b0899ff9108e31d0034526000f", "display_date": "October 15, 2018 · 20:09 UTC", "original_subtype": "IdnoPlugins\\Photo\\Photo"}